abstract: >-
  Research, an F0 benchmark suite, and a private inference application with
  signed nodes and transactional laboratory credits. The project prioritizes
  models above 27 billion parameters and documents memory, hardware, and
  communication requirements for contributed capacity. Includes local evidence
  and an economic study that rejected the fictional parameters tested.
  It is not an operational public decentralized network.
